OL,3,AIran warns of 'faster, heavier, more
OL,4,Apainful response' to US attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's top negotiator has warned of "a
OL,7,Ffaster, heavier, and more painful
OL,8,Fresponse" to US attacks, as hostilities
OL,9,Fbetween the two sides escalate.
OL,11,FParliament speaker Mohammad Bagher
OL,12,FGhalibaf said on Sunday that Americans
OL,13,Fmust understand "before it is too late"
OL,14,Fthat the "rules of the game have
OL,15,Fchanged", according to a translation of
OL,16,Fhis comments on state media.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
