OL,3,AIran warns of 'faster, heavier, more
OL,4,Apainful response' to US attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis comments come nearly a week into
OL,7,Frenewed fighting between Iran and the
OL,8,FUS, and a day after Washington said it
OL,9,Fstruck Iranian oil tankers in response
OL,10,Fto Tehran attacking American warships
OL,11,Fin the region's waters.
OL,13,FThe BBC has contacted US Central
OL,14,FCommand (Centcom) for comment.
